## Interface: 16001
## Title: Tinkerbox
## Notes: Small fixes for WoW Forever and other add-ons, made from outside them. Switch modules on or off in Options > AddOns > Tinkerbox; each module has its own page with its sections.
## Author: somecommoner
## Version: 0.3.0
## OptionalDeps: KinFolk, OneForAll
## SavedVariables: TinkerboxDB

Core/Core.lua
Core/Widgets.lua
Core/Options.lua

# Each folder is named after what it changes (Game/ for WoW itself). In a
# module's folder: the module first, then helpers, then its sections.
